Version 4
SHEET 1 4400 2100
TEXT 48 0 Left 3 ;EPC2361 DPT - named terminals connect electrically
TEXT 48 40 Left 2 ;REFINED: distributed power paths and private gate loops.
TEXT 48 72 Left 2 ;Re-export from the GUI after changing model mode or enabling local decoupling.
